Cosmalia Live — CachyOS based
==============================

Minimal COSMIC desktop: cosmic-comp-traffic + Noctalia.
You are logged in as 'liveuser' on tty1; Cosmalia starts automatically.

Install to disk:      Install Cosmalia (app menu) or cosmalia-installer
To get a root shell:  sudo -i
Session log:          cat "$XDG_RUNTIME_DIR/cosmalia-session.log"
Shell/services:       journalctl --user -b -u noctalia.service
